  "scientific_rationale": "All eleven captured MediaDive1608 receiving recipes were inspected. Seven JCM contexts explicitly say Sheffield and type A, and are source-scoped links to the existing C-P-NZAMINE-A product-family proposal. Four DSMZ contexts remain supplier/grade unspecified. The compound1608 identifier, generic CAS91079-40-2 and unqualified N-Z amine label do not establish universal TypeA identity.",
  "remaining_limits": "The four unspecified DSMZ contexts1762/548/552/554 still require supplier/grade evidence before TypeA linkage. Historical catalogue/lot equivalence and whole-owner/source-release obligations remain for the seven bounded product-family links; the scoped backlink is complete.",
